{
  "message": "I read “Sprint 2”: the second island and reef damage advance the goal, but the artifacts verify neither. Halfway through, the slice remains at risk without an accessible build or five-player results. With only Alex’s hours confirmed, make this last scope change: deliver a downloadable solo tide prototype by sprint 3’s end. At our next review, I look forward to your build and devlog showing how the tide changes sailing ;).",
  "agreed": [
    {
      "text": "By the end of sprint 3, share a downloadable solo prototype with one rough island and a tide cycle that changes a sailing route.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Prepare five-player testing for sprint 4: check whether players understand the tide’s effect, then share their findings and a final downloadable build.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    }
  ]
}

